fingerprint you are shown (on the line that begins with SHA256) with
the ones on the dashboard. If they do not match, answer no. You will
see an error:

    Host key verification failed.

That error means you got it right. Then bring the fingerprint to the
Lady of the Lake, from your own computer:

    ssh @@LOGIN@@ ./avalon/lady THE-WORD SHA256:...

Already answered yes? Your computer now trusts that server on that
